00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:21.250
So a little background.

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:22.720
For a lawsuit to go forward,

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:24.450
you have to write the
complaint, which lays out

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:27.290
