defendant, him or herself,

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:43.110
or you can serve the person
who has been designated

00:02:43.110 --> 00:02:46.300
to accept that service on
that defendant's behalf.

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:48.960
So, a corporation has to designate a agent

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:50.200
for service of process.

