00:03:57.830 --> 00:04:00.050
without their participation in that case,

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:01.630
and the ability to defend oneself.

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:03.610
This is a constitutional requirement.

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:06.730
Due process requires that the
