00:04:12.610 --> 00:04:15.310
and it's not a particularly
onerous process, either.

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:17.850
Under Rule 4 of the Federal
Rules of Civil Procedure,

00:04:17.850 --> 00:04:20.010
any person who is not
a party to the lawsuit,

00:04:20.010 --> 00:04:23.600
may deliver the lawsuit
papers to the defendant.

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:25.570
That person has to be over 18 years old.

00:04:25.570 --> 00:04:27.530
The plaintiff can use a process server,

00:04:27.530 --> 00:04:30.240
or send someone else,
but it has to be someone

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:32.400
other than the plaintiff to the lawsuit

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:34.020
actually delivering the papers.

00:04:34.020 --> 00:04:36.090
This prevents Tulsi
Gabbard from showing up

00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:37.770
on Hillary's front door with a summons,

