and a copy of her own complaint,

00:04:39.480 --> 00:04:41.690
even though that would make for great TV.

00:04:41.690 --> 00:04:43.350
Meanwhile the defendant can

00:04:43.350 --> 00:04:45.510
receive the papers, him or herself.

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:49.400
Often, this results in TV,
