00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:34.810
- In cases like this,
there's often a fine line

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:38.000
between evading service and
just simply not making it

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:40.510
as easy on the plaintiff as possible.

00:05:40.510 --> 00:05:43.560
It's generally not a good
