00:05:50.570 --> 00:05:52.330
make it easy on the plaintiff.

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:53.900
You might have a good reason for doing so.

00:05:53.900 --> 00:05:56.530
You can often get more
time to answer a complaint,

00:05:56.530 --> 00:05:58.530
if you just agree to accept service,

00:05:58.530 --> 00:05:59.470
if you know it's out there,

00:05:59.470 --> 00:06:00.750
but there's no requirement that you

00:06:00.750 --> 00:06:02.490
actually make it easy for them.

00:06:02.490 --> 00:06:05.180
So, this may be just a
case of tomato, tomato.

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:07.360
That what Gabbard is
saying, is evading service,

00:06:07.360 --> 00:06:09.120
Hillary Clinton is just saying,

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:10.340
I'm not gonna make it easy for you,

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:11.940
and I have no requirement to do so.

00:06:11.940 --> 00:06:13.960
And the same is generally
