00:06:40.910 --> 00:06:43.035
Hillary Clinton, but
even if Hillary Clinton

00:06:43.035 --> 00:06:45.300
is evading service, she won't be able

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:46.740
to evade service forever.

00:06:46.740 --> 00:06:48.740
The law gives Gabbard and her attorneys

00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:50.480
plenty of other options, including having

