00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:13.130
This is a method of service
that allows the plaintiff

00:07:13.130 --> 00:07:16.160
to just published the details
of the lawsuit in a newspaper,

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:19.330
and this is often used when
the defendant can't be found,

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:21.620
or is intentionally evading service.

00:07:21.620 --> 00:07:25.310
So Tulsi Gabbard filed her
